OL,3,AHundreds of French schools closed as
OL,4,Aminister says 40 head teachers injured
OL,5,Ain student protests
OL,6,
OL,7,FHundreds of schools in France are
OL,8,Fclosed as students continue to protest
OL,9,Fabout school conditions
OL,11,FThe demonstrations - over a lack of
OL,12,Fteachers, overcrowded classrooms and
OL,13,Frun-down buildings - started earlier
OL,14,Fthis week in Paris then spread across
OL,15,Fthe country
OL,17,FEducation minister Edouard Geffray
OL,18,Ftells French media that 65 school staff
OL,19,Fhave been injured, including 40
OL,20,Fheadteachers, and 1,949 arrests were
OL,21,Fmade on Thursday alone
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
