OL,3,AHundreds of French schools closed as
OL,4,Aminister says 40 head teachers injured
OL,5,Ain student protests
OL,6,
OL,7,FImages this morning show police in
OL,8,FBrest, western France, using tear gas
OL,9,Fagainst some protesters and a burnt
OL,10,Fpile of belongings outside a school
OL,11,Fentrance in Paris
OL,13,FA 16-year-old in the city of Rennes
OL,14,Ftells journalists the police response
OL,15,Fis making protesters "even angrier" -
OL,16,Fmeanwhile, France's justice minister
OL,17,FGerald Darmanin says "we have gone from
OL,18,Fhigh-school student demonstrations to a
OL,19,Fpublic order disturbance"
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
